        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion P7, Scroll Grab with Escutcheon Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmbellished with the ribbon and reed design of French Colonial architecture, Fusion Hardware's oval handleset with scroll grab is a great way to add an elegance to any home. The simple, yet sophisticated escutcheon will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. Plus, the beautiful detailing on the handle only adds to its loveliness. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 5 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Handleset With Decorated Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion P7 Solid Brass Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Scroll Grab Handleset, Fusion P7",
                "description": "Scroll Grab with Escutcheon Fusion P7 - Embellished with the ribbon and reed design of French Colonial architecture, Fusion Hardware's oval handleset with scroll grab is a great way to add an elegance to any home. The simple, yet sophisticated escutcheon will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. Plus, the beautiful detailing on the handle only adds to its loveliness. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 5 beautiful finishes. It will fit any door thickness form 1-3/8 inches up to 2 inches and is available in both 2-3/8 inch and 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
